WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.602
This query first creates daily revenue for each department.

00:00:03.602 --> 00:00:08.012
Then the window calculation adds the daily values cumulatively.

00:00:08.012 --> 00:00:15.147
Instead of reading the frame syntax aloud, focus on its meaning: begin with the first row in the department and include

00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:17.682
rows through the current day.

00:00:17.682 --> 00:00:21.427
Run the query and watch the cumulative value grow.

00:00:21.427 --> 00:00:25.095
When the department changes, the running total starts again.
